{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_023_02_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:d33f9af2bfec1f7b0a06b267c4893b13d0ee9f9a38c88c00fb89aad91b48a683",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000033:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e720de7db057f848a4719eb2f137d69dbf23c66873979ee8cc86edd499be3887",
      "text": "生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:90a82ab4ac1505ea803a902d23dd6d6bdc591f62469ce345b31ad57d9555cda0",
      "text": "哈哈，事务所也变成派对模式了！\n大家，谢谢你们啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:468ad7b1778786fe23bc32686a37763ea2cdae78b986abcaeff830476ca3a14a",
      "text": "现在高兴还太早了哦。\n来，虽然有点仓促，但这是我们送的礼物！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:374a6e2dbb894d2d348d0e15ee0142095f4c116abe744937e55babe4d25b1f1e",
      "text": "哎！？那是……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000114:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f84faa006e31011b057293758529f1ae4668f52d796cf61c6044c0d3a484dc0",
      "text": "锵锵锵——！\n我精挑细选的！超绝Mega好吃甜甜圈！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000119:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7de678e13c1ad2f78b879340b24b30c2179db25c3cc93d559a814277d600d52",
      "text": "每个人都选了各自认为最好吃的甜甜圈带来的。\n我们按顺序送给你吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000135:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf9aebf5b2a97dccf8954ceb2ea8c02ae86bc4b46e078477b588be6199514346",
      "text": "这是我挑的！\n是到处寻访试吃找到的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5330b7a6ab7deddd08ef8c8a23a202b1d14ba0e9a8aaae9962b69e5207925795",
      "text": "我的是，这个……\n做成了猫咪形状……很可爱……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000155:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4725186b0a3eed152ac1c017e8ed5b5edaa619f1c4255aaf8490cf2fa3229ab",
      "text": "这个是我送的。\n是百货商店限量销售的商品。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000170:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eed3305b8d92985a335cad910109c1d2435ae48a1bca71c1155a65d97bcfe56b",
      "text": "我的总而言之就是Mega华丽！超上镜！\n在社交平台上热度拉满的那款哦～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000180:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d793632e354644448d2bd57b37aa35e15669e6093765ecf6ba2d5615c3de13a3",
      "text": "我也准备了一份。\n我想春名先生也一定会喜欢的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000186:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4a6c5abed011247ec01b6485d3c29fe4c37ef79d9768181a1a50603e895cc46",
      "text": "大家，谢谢你们。\n我真的超级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000192:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e82a8a70283635b1ea2a81ef557a95714808b808f8e423b2dadb5f60fa40aaea",
      "text": "想早点吃，但又觉得舍不得……\n不，我全都会好好品尝的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000206:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57f289833eedd8ee57cd4c710ef8d66f61b4123a2bb5c87e95feea4fdd6f0e1a",
      "text": "你能喜欢真是太好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000211:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f826c0f2acc1eb47d9da29a56368f504f6177b3775a105eb10484f590832c3e",
      "text": "啊，不过不要吃得太急哦！\n被甜甜圈噎到的话，会非常难受的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000225:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8814558178b57bdb93b5a3db63decf280229101c79ac7586dcbc9d3c6effb52f",
      "text": "很有真实感呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000231:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:164205f65ce08136c1ac1c3e543fa2462d87ccb13353c6320384d9bed5f5d2ee",
      "text": "大家都很期待……让春名尝尝。\n……多吃点哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_023har_02_1_2_023_02:1_2_023_02_e:cmd-000263:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:270cc5e04448c7f40884a1cd61759f4f961e5b3411bacb955d765028d5e930ab",
      "text": "哦，那我可得好好品尝了。\n大家，真的太感谢了！这是最棒的生日！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
